WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.468
Salom!

2
00:00:00.468 --> 00:00:03.820
Endi yuqori tartibli tenglamalarga o‘tamiz.

3
00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:12.630
Telefon balandlikdan tushganda uning balandligi ikkinchi hosila minus g ga teng degan tenglamani qanoatlantiradi.

4
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:19.646
Bunday tenglamalarni qanday yechish va qachon tartibini pasaytirish mumkinligini ko‘ramiz.

5
00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:25.682
n-tartibli tenglamaning umumiy yechimida n ta ixtiyoriy o‘zgarmas bor.

6
00:00:25.682 --> 00:00:34.775
Koshi masalasida bitta nuqtada n ta shart beriladi: funksiya va uning n minus birinchi tartibgacha hosilalari.

7
00:00:34.775 --> 00:00:41.718
Agar o‘ng tomon uzluksiz va noma’lumlar bo‘yicha xususiy hosilalari uzluksiz bo‘lsa,

8
00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:44.198
yechim lokal mavjud va yagona.

9
00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:48.684
Birinchi tur: y ning n-hosilasi faqat x ga bog‘liq.

10
00:00:48.684 --> 00:00:55.662
Masalan, y uch shtrix teng yigirma to‘rt x, boshlang‘ich qiymatlar bir, nol va ikki.

11
00:00:55.662 --> 00:01:04.549
Integrallaymiz va har safar o‘zgarmasni darhol topamiz: y ikki shtrix teng o‘n ikki x kvadrat qo‘shuv ikki,

12
00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:13.022
y shtrix teng to‘rt x kub qo‘shuv ikki x, va y teng x to‘rtinchi daraja qo‘shuv x kvadrat qo‘shuv bir.

13
00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:17.100
Ikkinchi tur: y qatnashmagan tenglama.

14
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:23.044
Masalan, x y ikki shtrix minus y shtrix teng uch x kvadrat.

15
00:01:23.044 --> 00:01:30.600
z teng y shtrix desak, z uchun chiziqli birinchi tartibli tenglama chiqadi.

16
00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:36.745
x kvadratga bo‘lsak, z ning x ga nisbati hosilasi uchga teng.

17
00:01:36.745 --> 00:01:47.726
Demak z teng uch x kvadrat qo‘shuv C bir x, va y teng x kub qo‘shuv C bir x kvadratning yarmi qo‘shuv C ikki.

18
00:01:47.976 --> 00:01:55.579
Uchinchi tur: x qatnashmagan tenglama, masalan y ikki shtrix teng ikki y kub.

19
00:01:55.579 --> 00:02:00.713
y shtrix teng p, p esa y ning funksiyasi deb olamiz.

20
00:02:00.713 --> 00:02:07.525
Zanjir qoidasi bo‘yicha y ikki shtrix teng p ko‘paytirilgan dp dy ga.

21
00:02:07.525 --> 00:02:09.895
Muhim: faqat dp dy emas!

22
00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:16.214
Integrallasak, p kvadrat teng y to‘rtinchi daraja qo‘shuv C bir.

23
00:02:16.464 --> 00:02:23.210
Boshlang‘ich shartlar y nolda bir, y shtrix nolda bir bo‘lsin.

24
00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:27.779
Unda C bir nolga teng va p teng y kvadrat.

25
00:02:27.779 --> 00:02:37.789
Ajratsak, minus bir bo‘lingan y teng x minus bir, ya’ni y teng bir bo‘lingan bir minus x ga.

26
00:02:37.789 --> 00:02:47.798
Yechim faqat x birdan kichik bo‘lganda mavjud: x birga yaqinlashganda u cheksizlikka ketadi.

27
00:02:48.048 --> 00:02:53.562
Grafikda y teng bir bo‘lingan bir minus x ko‘rsatilgan.

28
00:02:53.562 --> 00:02:57.974
U nol nuqtada birga teng va og‘ishi ham bir.

29
00:02:57.974 --> 00:03:06.094
x birga yaqinlashganda egri chiziq vertikal asimptotaga tomon keskin ko‘tariladi.

30
00:03:06.094 --> 00:03:12.110
Chiziqli bo‘lmagan tenglamalarda bunday portlash odatiy hol.

31
00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:19.540
O‘zingizni tekshiring: x qatnashmagan tenglamada y ikki shtrix qanday ifodalanadi?

32
00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:22.430
Javobni tanlang va izohni o‘qing.
